{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmdii1yjqbk0","created":1792890109866,"text":"心功能不全"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdinz37me80","created":1792890573803,"text":"1.病因及分类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdiop34ulc0","created":1792890630394,"text":"什么是心功能不全/心衰？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdip7180hk0","created":1792890669461,"text":"心功能不全"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdipi60sa80","created":1792890693696,"text":"由于心脏舒缩功能降低或心室充盈受限\n导致的心脏泵血功能降低。\n包括代偿期和失代偿期","layout":null,"color":"#ff0000","background":"#daeef3","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiqkp89co0","created":1792890777575,"text":"心力衰竭"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdiqn4lk4g0","created":1792890782858,"text":"在有足够循环血量的情况下，由于心脏舒缩功能障碍，\n导致心排血量绝对/相对不足，不能满足机体代谢需要\n而导致的以循环功能为主的综合征。\n是心功能不全的失代偿期","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","color":"#ff0000","background":"#daeef3"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdisgew7s00","created":1792890924971,"text":"心力衰竭如何分类？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdisrqrvf40","created":1792890949634,"text":"按部位"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdisthhy200","created":1792890953427,"text":"左心衰"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdisv5hl6g0","created":1792890957054,"text":"右心衰"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiswl8ye80","created":1792890960184,"text":"全心衰"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdit7i3qag0","created":1792890983938,"text":"按心输出量"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdita0yet40","created":1792890989432,"text":"低输出量型心衰"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmditfdusew0","created":1792891001096,"text":"高输出量型心衰"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmditnb53o80","created":1792891018346,"text":"按速度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmditoef2bc0","created":1792891020721,"text":"急性心衰"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmditq2cys80","created":1792891024345,"text":"慢性心衰"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmditsq7fo80","created":1792891030141,"text":"按发生机制\n（收缩/舒张障碍）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdiu2pb8480","created":1792891051854,"text":"收缩功能障碍型心衰"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiu7305n40","created":1792891061389,"text":"舒张功能障碍性心衰"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiuaubrk00","created":1792891069572,"text":"混合型心衰","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiufu6mk00","created":1792891080447,"text":"按左室射血分数LVEF\n（每搏输出量占心室舒张末期容积量的百分比）\n（安静状态下约55~65%）","color":"#ff0000","font-weight":"bold","background":"#ffff00"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdivg2dt800","created":1792891159307,"text":"（1）射血分数降低型心衰HFrEF"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdj6ifvf6o0","created":1792892026482,"text":"EF＜40%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdj6n08oi00","created":1792892036421,"text":"收缩性HF，有效治疗已得到证实"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdivrofhds0","created":1792891184585,"text":"（2）射血分数保留型心衰HFpEF"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdj70x9hls0","created":1792892066716,"text":"EF≥50%"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdj90tk4ew0","created":1792892223220,"text":"舒张性HF，有效治疗尚不明确"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdj3j0hyls0","created":1792891792637,"text":"a.HFmEF（射血分数轻度降低）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdj9wclwmg0","created":1792892291852,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdj44k0enk0","created":1792891839529,"text":"b.HFimpEF（射血分数改善）"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdio652fs00","created":1792890589152,"text":"2.发生机制"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdio9drp3k0","created":1792890596209,"text":"3.对机体的影响"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiogfdhiw0","created":1792890611543,"text":"4.防止原则"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}